{"id": "Dfd0crvPtb3", "title": "Video by feartalkies", "description": "A girl who slept beside the princess every night… became a man. They married in secret. Then her father wed her to a stranger.\n\nLast tale's answer: Vikram said the king. A general of good family dying for his master is no wonder, servants are bound to protect their masters even with their lives. But kings are puffed up with pride and break the moral law when bent on enjoyment, so a king who kept the law, and died for it, was the more loyal.\n\nVikram & Betaal: Two Husbands.\n\nThe parts we couldn't fit in the reel: the city was Sivapura in old Nepal, the king was Yasahketu and the princess was Sasiprabha. The minister's son who fell for the \"girl\" had a first wife, Mrigankavati. And in both older Indian tellings of this tale, the princess was already carrying Manaswami's child.\n\nSo, the love she chose… or her family's choice? Comment your pick, and send this to someone who'd choose differently. 👇\n\n#vikrambetaal #indianhorror #ghoststories #indianfolklore #horrorstories", "channel": "feartalkies", "uploader_id": "58803293522", "uploader": "Fear Talkies | Indian Horror", "timestamp": 1794109526, "like_count": 860, "comment_count": 6, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2179413802784058a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.38, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPrYixVcguFO3tMII4R8UfkQR3WPkALo7rlNAZ_pt3rdjttwhJJHD-3Wl5B_fWxzT-_jTSjutHMRVCyPDVKlAA0OhojNRuCv7xaYdc.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Adqo4qM7hH3uzTGDB7oEkN6YSt46UemBCQjOoSA_FUkCKiO8H7j1AmN__ex